{"n": 268, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "268.webp", "text": "213 656\n\nDDE\n1351320 BLEEDING FUEL SYSTEM\n\nAlways begin bleeding procedures on the fuel\nfilter,\n\nLoosen bleeder screw (10)\n\nUnlock cap of manual pump (8) by turning\n90° and pump so long. unt fuel runs out of\nthe bleeder screw (10).\n\nLock manual pump (8)\n\nUnscrew coupling nut with Special Tool\n135.020 while counterholding on odapter,\nif there is air in the pipe in front of the\ninjection pump.\n\nOperate manual pump on fuel filter until ar\nbubbles escape,\n\nM2113 254\n\nBleading Injection Pump\n\nUnscrew plug two turns.\n\nCrank engine with starter until fuel runs out\nThen tighten plug again.\n\nTightening torque: 14 + 6 Nm (10 + 4 ft. ths.)\n\nBleeding Injection Pipes:\n\nUnscrew all coupling nuts on fuel nozzles with\nSpecial Tool 13 5 020,\n\nCrank engine with starter until fuel runs out of\nthe pipes.\n\nTighten nuts again.\n\nTightening torque: 20 + 5 Nim (14.5 + 3.5 ft\nbs.)", "words": [["213", 0.2022, 0.2725, 0.2224, 0.2817], ["656", 0.2255, 0.2725, 0.2427, 0.2804], ["DDE", 0.2644, 0.0694, 0.2856, 0.08], ["1351320", 0.2654, 0.0866, 0.3129, 0.0959], ["BLEEDING", 0.3251, 0.0866, 0.3817, 0.0979], ["FUEL", 0.3857, 0.0866, 0.4135, 0.0979], ["SYSTEM", 0.4176, 0.0866, 0.4611, 0.0979], ["Always", 0.2644, 0.119, 0.2978, 0.131], ["begin", 0.3018, 0.119, 0.3271, 0.131], ["bleeding", 0.3301, 0.119, 0.3696, 0.1323], ["procedures", 0.3726, 0.119, 0.4247, 0.131], ["on", 0.4277, 0.1217, 0.4398, 0.1283], ["the", 0.4439, 0.119, 0.458, 0.1283], ["fuel", 0.4621, 0.119, 0.4793, 0.1296], ["filter,", 0.2644, 0.1349, 0.2897, 0.1455], ["Loosen", 0.2644, 0.1508, 0.2978, 0.1614], ["bleeder", 0.3018, 0.1508, 0.3352, 0.1614], ["screw", 0.3392, 0.1534, 0.3645, 0.1614], ["(10)", 0.3696, 0.1508, 0.3878, 0.1614], ["Unlock", 0.2644, 0.1667, 0.2978, 0.1772], ["cap", 0.3018, 0.1693, 0.318, 0.1786], ["of", 0.321, 0.1667, 0.3301, 0.1772], ["manual", 0.3352, 0.168, 0.3686, 0.1772], ["pump", 0.3716, 0.1693, 0.3989, 0.17